<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="skill">bronze-helm</ansi> (blacksmithing recipe)

A helm of bronze, against iron: protection x0.95, weight x1.1. Bronze is
nearly as good as iron and handsome with it, if a little heavier.

<ansi fg="yellow">━━━ Crafting ━━━</ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Skill:</ansi>       blacksmithing (minimum 12)
  <ansi fg="yellow">Station:</ansi>     forge
  <ansi fg="yellow">Ingredients:</ansi> bronze ingot (x3), leather strip (x1)

